#
# Sourced from drivers/Kconfig in place of drivers/kernelsu/Kconfig when the
# KernelSU-Next submodule is not checked out (see KSU_KCONFIG in the top
# Makefile). Intentionally defines nothing: with no CONFIG_KSU* symbols,
# KernelSU and the susfs hooks compile out and the kernel builds without them.
# To build with KernelSU:  git submodule update --init KernelSU-Next
